\item Areas of dense gas clouds can be better observed by using a telescope that detects shorter wavelengths.
\item The electromagnetic spectrum contains all of the kinds of light, including those the human eye cannot see.
\item Humans can see infrared, which is the portion of the electromagnetic spectrum immediately beyond red.
\end{enumerate}

